1
00:00:04,290 --> 00:00:06,290
Shouldn’t you be entertaining your guest?

2
00:00:06,290 --> 00:00:08,080
Uncle Ma told me to grab a bottle of wine

3
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:11,500
He said the one who booked me is his VIP guest

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,000
VIP guest?

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:13,960
He even told me to go to the wine cellar

6
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,420
and bring out the best one for her

7
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:51,420
Easy there, missy—fight all you want

8
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:52,250
but watch yourself

9
00:01:06,540 --> 00:01:09,710
Looks like I picked the right person to worship

10
00:01:09,710 --> 00:01:12,539
So—who sent you?

11
00:01:14,630 --> 00:01:15,789
Why Pan Hao?

12
00:01:18,420 --> 00:01:20,289
Rules of the underworld

13
00:01:20,289 --> 00:01:21,750
You really think I’d tell you?

14
00:01:27,420 --> 00:01:31,460
Thanks—I was worried I might beat you

15
00:01:31,460 --> 00:01:32,460
Then I’d lose

16
00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:33,789
the only person worth admiring

17
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:06,080
Hi beautiful, leaving so soon?

18
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:07,670
I just brought the wine for you

19
00:02:57,630 --> 00:03:00,170
Hi beautiful, leaving so soon?

20
00:03:00,170 --> 00:03:01,790
I just brought the wine for you

21
00:03:20,790 --> 00:03:23,250
Miss, I think that’s enough for today

22
00:03:23,250 --> 00:03:25,880
Feel free to come again anytime

23
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,750
Tips

24
00:03:30,750 --> 00:03:31,880
Thanks for your hard work

25
00:03:39,579 --> 00:03:42,380
Uncle Ma, your VIP guest…

26
00:03:42,380 --> 00:03:44,829
is she a bit…

27
00:03:44,829 --> 00:03:46,790
off?

28
00:03:48,170 --> 00:03:49,630
Take the wine back

29
00:03:49,630 --> 00:03:52,079
I just brought it over

30
00:03:52,079 --> 00:03:53,420
And?

31
00:03:56,290 --> 00:03:57,540
Nothing

32
00:04:23,670 --> 00:04:26,380
I was just in the VIP room

33
00:04:26,380 --> 00:04:28,880
and saw my uncle fighting someone

34
00:04:29,750 --> 00:04:32,000
He's fast, ruthless and precise,

35
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:34,000
definitely not ordinary

36
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,170
It's pro-level,

37
00:04:36,170 --> 00:04:38,540
even more skilled than some gangsters

38
00:04:40,170 --> 00:04:42,710
If I’m right,

39
00:04:42,710 --> 00:04:46,210
he is the assassin known as “The Elder”

40
00:04:48,250 --> 00:04:51,630
"The Elder" of A.D.S.… is my uncle?

41
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:55,630
There’s been a legend in the underworld

42
00:04:56,330 --> 00:04:59,380
about a top assassin called “The Elder”

43
00:04:59,380 --> 00:05:01,250
He moves in the shadows

44
00:05:01,250 --> 00:05:03,750
never leaves a trace

45
00:05:03,750 --> 00:05:06,960
and never misses

46
00:05:08,630 --> 00:05:11,960
But he vanished decades ago

47
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:13,920
No one knows where he is

48
00:05:15,630 --> 00:05:18,540
I don’t think my uncle could be an assassin

49
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:19,670
But what I just saw…

50
00:05:24,750 --> 00:05:26,750
I’ve always known he’s skilled

51
00:05:26,750 --> 00:05:28,710
I’ve seen punks come after him

52
00:05:28,710 --> 00:05:30,040
but I thought it was just…

53
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,380
him teaching bad guys a lesson

54
00:05:31,380 --> 00:05:32,750
punishing evil

55
00:05:33,500 --> 00:05:36,080
Could he really be that legendary assassin?

56
00:05:42,500 --> 00:05:44,170
Whatever the truth is

57
00:05:44,170 --> 00:05:46,000
it’s his past

58
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,880
Instead of guessing

59
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:50,250
why don't you just ask him?

60
00:06:20,420 --> 00:06:21,380
Hey

61
00:06:28,540 --> 00:06:30,250
Shouldn’t you be resting when you’re sick?

62
00:06:30,250 --> 00:06:32,170
Why are you working late again?

63
00:06:32,170 --> 00:06:34,710
Being sick doesn’t mean I can’t move

64
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:38,420
Not bad

65
00:06:38,420 --> 00:06:40,960
At least you finished the chicken soup

66
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:43,040
Good

67
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,130
Thanks to you

68
00:06:44,130 --> 00:06:44,920
I can now

69
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:47,040
get back to work

70
00:06:47,830 --> 00:06:48,330
Wait a second

71
00:06:48,330 --> 00:06:50,960
I made the soup to help you recover

72
00:06:50,960 --> 00:06:53,750
not to fuel more overtime

73
00:06:53,750 --> 00:06:56,790
I feel much better, don’t worry

74
00:06:56,790 --> 00:06:58,380
Really

75
00:06:58,380 --> 00:07:00,630
You’re terrible at taking care of yourself

76
00:07:00,630 --> 00:07:03,170
You should rest when you’re sick

77
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,960
Work’s not going anywhere

78
00:07:06,790 --> 00:07:09,670
I'm old enough not to nagging all day

79
00:07:09,670 --> 00:07:10,920
and I don’t like it either

80
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:12,540
When you're sick, you need rest

81
00:07:12,540 --> 00:07:14,500
Sufficient rest will prevent you from getting sick

82
00:07:14,500 --> 00:07:17,290
How many times do I have to repeat myself?

83
00:07:20,710 --> 00:07:22,170
I’ll make you some porridge

84
00:07:31,080 --> 00:07:33,170
Someone actually dared to send a hitman

85
00:07:33,170 --> 00:07:37,130
to target Pan Hao at the club

86
00:07:37,130 --> 00:07:38,540
Could it be Chao De-chiang?

87
00:07:40,380 --> 00:07:41,750
Impossible

88
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,710
He wouldn’t dare

89
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,580
Then there’s only one possibility

90
00:07:49,330 --> 00:07:51,000
The F.T. Crew

91
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:57,580
Looks like from now on

92
00:07:58,210 --> 00:08:00,210
we need to keep a close eye on Pan Hao

93
00:08:00,210 --> 00:08:02,670
and Yuchuan as well

94
00:08:04,290 --> 00:08:06,130
We need to stay on high alert

95
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:10,630
Got it, don’t worry

96
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:13,040
I’ll keep an eye on everything

97
00:08:37,330 --> 00:08:40,500
You used to be decisive and efficient

98
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:42,919
never dragging things out

99
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,670
What happened this time?

100
00:08:48,540 --> 00:08:50,750
Don’t tell me you’ve caught real feelings

101
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:54,290
This mission

102
00:08:55,250 --> 00:08:58,670
is harder than expected

103
00:08:58,670 --> 00:09:00,170
Hard?

104
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,920
Don’t forget who you are

105
00:09:07,210 --> 00:09:10,290
You should know what I'd do

106
00:09:10,290 --> 00:09:12,380
if there’s no progress

107
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:26,500
What should I do?

108
00:09:27,830 --> 00:09:30,750
It’s time to tell Pan Hao the truth

109
00:09:50,580 --> 00:09:51,880
Hey, Rourou

110
00:09:55,210 --> 00:09:55,790
Rourou

111
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:58,540
Hello? Rourou, what’s going on?

112
00:10:18,330 --> 00:10:20,040
What do we do?

113
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:22,040
Rourou’s been kidnapped

114
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:23,170
What?

115
00:10:23,170 --> 00:10:24,710
I just got a message

116
00:10:24,710 --> 00:10:27,130
from her phone

117
00:10:28,170 --> 00:10:29,420
Let me see

118
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:30,790
I’ll try to track the location

119
00:10:30,790 --> 00:10:31,830
What should we do?

120
00:10:31,830 --> 00:10:33,830
Look how much trouble your diamonds have caused

121
00:10:34,630 --> 00:10:36,170
I didn’t want this either

122
00:10:36,170 --> 00:10:37,960
That’s why I planned

123
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:40,790
to take her to Thailand next month

124
00:10:40,790 --> 00:10:42,040
How was I supposed to know

125
00:10:45,540 --> 00:10:46,750
What are these for?

126
00:10:46,750 --> 00:10:48,380
To save Rourou

127
00:10:48,380 --> 00:10:50,330
Will these even help?

128
00:10:51,290 --> 00:10:53,210
Better than going with empty-handed

129
00:10:55,170 --> 00:10:56,250
I picked up something awesome on the way

130
00:10:56,250 --> 00:10:57,880
Wanna try?

131
00:10:57,880 --> 00:11:00,630
Chenghan

132
00:11:00,630 --> 00:11:02,130
You’re finally back

133
00:11:02,130 --> 00:11:03,750
I missed you so much

134
00:11:04,540 --> 00:11:07,130
What’s with you—do I owe you money?

135
00:11:07,130 --> 00:11:08,540
I just missed you

136
00:11:08,540 --> 00:11:09,500
What’s going on now?

137
00:11:09,500 --> 00:11:10,080
Why do you look like

138
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,670
you’re about to get beaten up?

139
00:11:12,670 --> 00:11:14,670
Do I really look like that?

140
00:11:14,670 --> 00:11:16,330
Yeah

141
00:11:16,330 --> 00:11:18,380
See… I told you it won't work

142
00:11:18,380 --> 00:11:19,330
It's not the gear… it's you

143
00:11:19,330 --> 00:11:20,290
You are the problem

144
00:11:20,290 --> 00:11:20,960
What's wrong with me?

145
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:22,670
Why did you give me all this useless crap?

146
00:11:22,670 --> 00:11:23,750
You two

147
00:11:23,750 --> 00:11:24,750
Calling me a loser

148
00:11:24,750 --> 00:11:25,130
Do you think I’m useless?

149
00:11:25,130 --> 00:11:26,960
Are you going to rescue her or not?

150
00:11:27,750 --> 00:11:29,500
Got the location

151
00:11:29,500 --> 00:11:30,920
In an abandoned house

152
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:32,830
Be careful

153
00:11:32,830 --> 00:11:34,580
Thanks, Lee Xun

154
00:11:35,670 --> 00:11:36,500
Let’s go

155
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:37,130
Where to?

156
00:11:37,130 --> 00:11:38,380
Wait

157
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,210
Just in case

158
00:11:45,330 --> 00:11:46,130
Did you ask me?

159
00:11:46,130 --> 00:11:47,250
You're the thoughtful one

160
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:48,750
Let’s go

161
00:11:50,170 --> 00:11:51,920
Let’s go save her

162
00:12:21,500 --> 00:12:23,420
You guys

163
00:12:23,420 --> 00:12:25,170
What do you want?

164
00:12:26,210 --> 00:12:28,630
Pan Hao’s diamonds have nothing to do with me

165
00:12:50,330 --> 00:12:52,540
That’s not up to you

166
00:12:54,130 --> 00:12:56,380
Since you’re his woman

167
00:12:58,830 --> 00:13:03,250
he should show some sincerity

168
00:13:23,130 --> 00:13:23,830
Hurry...

169
00:13:23,830 --> 00:13:25,250
Speed up

170
00:13:25,250 --> 00:13:26,920
Is this the right direction?

171
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:27,540
Let me check

172
00:13:27,540 --> 00:13:29,670
It is! I’m not an idiot

173
00:13:29,670 --> 00:13:31,500
You should’ve notified me sooner

174
00:13:31,500 --> 00:13:32,670
You fail as a passenger

175
00:13:32,670 --> 00:13:33,580
so as a boyfriend

176
00:13:33,580 --> 00:13:34,880
Now your girlfriend got kidnapped

177
00:13:34,880 --> 00:13:36,330
Hey, I pass as a boyfriend

178
00:13:36,330 --> 00:13:38,420
Here—turn right

179
00:13:39,540 --> 00:13:40,790
I told you to say it earlier

180
00:13:40,790 --> 00:13:42,210
I already did

181
00:13:42,210 --> 00:13:43,790
Watch for speeding cameras

182
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:47,250
You’ve got 50 million USD and still worry about that?

183
00:13:47,250 --> 00:13:49,290
Looks like I missed a lot

184
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,670
You look best when driving

185
00:13:53,750 --> 00:13:55,790
There —turn left

186
00:13:58,750 --> 00:14:00,380
Damn it

187
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:05,540
Hey, routine check

188
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:20,750
Senior Chen

189
00:14:20,750 --> 00:14:21,790
It really is you

190
00:14:21,790 --> 00:14:23,540
When did you transfer units?

191
00:14:23,540 --> 00:14:24,960
Why didn’t I hear anything?

192
00:14:25,540 --> 00:14:27,040
Senior?

193
00:14:30,500 --> 00:14:31,580
Senior

194
00:14:32,130 --> 00:14:33,290
Hurry up

195
00:14:37,710 --> 00:14:39,500
Special op.

196
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:42,000
Senior

197
00:14:42,670 --> 00:14:43,670
Let’s exchange contact

198
00:14:43,670 --> 00:14:45,580
and hang out sometime

199
00:14:45,580 --> 00:14:46,920
Add his contact…

200
00:14:56,210 --> 00:14:58,540
Wishing you success in the mission

201
00:15:04,210 --> 00:15:05,790
So you used to be a cop?

202
00:15:05,790 --> 00:15:08,040
Not “used to”—I still am a cop

203
00:15:08,040 --> 00:15:10,210
So cops can moonlight as hosts now?

204
00:15:10,210 --> 00:15:11,540
That’s pretty open-minded

205
00:15:11,540 --> 00:15:13,670
Didn’t I say I’m on a special mission?

206
00:15:13,670 --> 00:15:14,500
A host AND on a mission?

207
00:15:14,500 --> 00:15:16,460
That’s wild

208
00:15:16,460 --> 00:15:17,540
Are you going to rescue her or not?

209
00:15:17,540 --> 00:15:18,460
What are you even talking about?

210
00:15:18,460 --> 00:15:19,420
Just give directions already

211
00:15:19,420 --> 00:15:20,460
Go straight

212
00:15:20,460 --> 00:15:21,500
Hey, aren’t you supposed to hold the wheel?

213
00:15:21,500 --> 00:15:22,460
Hey... hey... hey...

214
00:15:22,460 --> 00:15:24,460
Watch out! Do you know how to drive?

215
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:26,540
Being handsome doesn’t mean you can let go of it!

216
00:15:28,250 --> 00:15:29,750
I’m telling you

217
00:15:29,750 --> 00:15:31,790
You won’t get your way.

218
00:15:33,500 --> 00:15:35,920
Talking down on me already?

219
00:15:37,170 --> 00:15:38,790
That’s not okay

220
00:15:58,170 --> 00:15:59,080
Over there

221
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,420
Go around that way

222
00:16:21,670 --> 00:16:23,500
Honestly

223
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:25,540
I start to wonder if we’re here to rescue someone

224
00:16:25,540 --> 00:16:27,880
or just to eat hot pot

225
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:30,080
You think I want to carry this?

226
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:33,500
The cop gave it to me—I had no choice

227
00:16:33,500 --> 00:16:34,580
Focus

228
00:16:34,580 --> 00:16:36,460
Yes, sir

229
00:16:36,460 --> 00:16:37,790
Hurry up

230
00:17:17,040 --> 00:17:18,130
Release her

231
00:17:22,170 --> 00:17:24,790
Pan Hao must be important

232
00:17:24,790 --> 00:17:27,079
He even had you to negotiate

233
00:17:29,750 --> 00:17:30,920
I don’t negotiate

234
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,130
Don’t move

235
00:18:04,790 --> 00:18:06,380
Learn nothing good

236
00:18:06,380 --> 00:18:07,460
but to copy kidnappers instead

237
00:18:07,460 --> 00:18:08,630
wanna be a bad boy?

238
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:14,880
Don’t come closer

239
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:16,170
I’ll kill her

240
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:31,040
It’s not locked

241
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:34,420
He said it’s not locked

242
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:53,250
Baby

243
00:18:55,170 --> 00:18:56,880
Are you okay?

244
00:18:57,670 --> 00:18:59,670
What took you so long?

245
00:18:59,670 --> 00:19:02,130
I got delayed

246
00:19:02,130 --> 00:19:04,250
because we ran into a checkpoint

247
00:19:04,250 --> 00:19:05,630
Looks like we’re late

248
00:19:06,670 --> 00:19:07,710
Uncle Ma...

249
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:11,420
Uncle? What are you doing here?

250
00:19:16,170 --> 00:19:17,830
Pan Hao

251
00:19:17,830 --> 00:19:19,380
Do I still need this?

252
00:19:20,460 --> 00:19:22,750
Bro, can you be serious?

253
00:19:22,750 --> 00:19:24,580
I’m rescuing the damsel here

254
00:19:24,580 --> 00:19:25,790
Uncle Ma did, not you

255
00:19:25,790 --> 00:19:26,920
None of your business

256
00:19:29,080 --> 00:19:30,290
No need to go after him

257
00:19:32,170 --> 00:19:33,790
Whoever sent him for the diamonds

258
00:19:34,130 --> 00:19:36,040
is even more eager to catch him than we are

259
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:11,040
Don’t be afraid

260
00:20:11,670 --> 00:20:13,540
You're safe now

261
00:20:14,290 --> 00:20:15,960
Get some rest

262
00:20:15,960 --> 00:20:17,830
I’ll stay with you

263
00:20:17,830 --> 00:20:20,460
Don’t sneak away

264
00:20:20,460 --> 00:20:24,040
Don’t worry, I’ll be right here,

265
00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:25,540
not going anywhere

266
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:48,080
Pan Hao

267
00:20:53,330 --> 00:20:56,000
There’s something I need to tell you

268
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:58,290
Go ahead, I’m listening

269
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:06,750
Getting close to you

270
00:21:08,750 --> 00:21:10,130
wasn’t a coincidence

271
00:21:13,790 --> 00:21:16,250
Chou Qin had me approach you

272
00:21:20,710 --> 00:21:22,290
What do you mean?

273
00:21:25,210 --> 00:21:29,290
She is Chiang's mistress from A.D.S.

274
00:21:30,670 --> 00:21:33,380
She trained me herself

275
00:21:35,380 --> 00:21:36,710
She gave me

276
00:21:36,710 --> 00:21:38,500
everything I have now

277
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:10,130
Chiang

278
00:22:11,330 --> 00:22:13,790
The girl on the far right

279
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:16,250
I want her

280
00:23:13,130 --> 00:23:16,670
From now on, you belong to me

281
00:23:22,670 --> 00:23:24,790
Whoever I've chosen

282
00:23:24,790 --> 00:23:26,790
gets more than just this stage

283
00:23:32,250 --> 00:23:33,830
Give me your best

284
00:23:50,420 --> 00:23:51,920
From that moment on

285
00:23:53,630 --> 00:23:55,920
I started helping her

286
00:23:55,920 --> 00:23:59,130
with things she couldn’t do herself

287
00:24:00,580 --> 00:24:02,210
To put it bluntly

288
00:24:02,210 --> 00:24:04,670
I was her proxy

289
00:24:06,040 --> 00:24:08,210
So…

290
00:24:09,290 --> 00:24:11,250
You got close to me

291
00:24:12,250 --> 00:24:14,790
because of her instruction?

292
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:21,960
When I first found out the target was you

293
00:24:22,830 --> 00:24:24,880
I struggled

294
00:24:26,790 --> 00:24:30,500
Because I really liked you back then

295
00:24:31,580 --> 00:24:35,540
You really liked me back then?

296
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:41,630
Otherwise, what do you think

297
00:24:42,330 --> 00:24:45,130
I'd kept this the whole time?

298
00:24:51,540 --> 00:24:52,790
Pan Hao

299
00:24:53,710 --> 00:24:54,670
I...

300
00:24:55,670 --> 00:24:58,540
I can’t go against Chou Qin

301
00:25:00,670 --> 00:25:01,750
But…

302
00:25:02,500 --> 00:25:07,000
The longer I am with you

303
00:25:08,250 --> 00:25:10,330
The heavier my guilt becomes

304
00:25:11,710 --> 00:25:13,630
Until today

305
00:25:14,500 --> 00:25:15,830
When I was kidnapped

306
00:25:15,830 --> 00:25:18,500
You came to rescue me without hesitation

307
00:25:18,500 --> 00:25:20,420
I realized

308
00:25:21,540 --> 00:25:23,670
I can’t lie to you anymore

309
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:29,540
I can’t complete the mission anyway

310
00:25:29,540 --> 00:25:31,330
Chou Qin won’t let me go

311
00:25:32,040 --> 00:25:35,540
I don’t know what to do

312
00:25:43,710 --> 00:25:44,920
Don’t be afraid

313
00:25:47,580 --> 00:25:49,380
We’ll find a way

314
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:42,500
You two are so much alike

315
00:26:42,500 --> 00:26:44,500
Neither of you wants to speak first

316
00:26:45,630 --> 00:26:46,880
Talk it out yourselves

317
00:26:49,040 --> 00:26:49,880
Some things

318
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:52,170
need to be made clear when it's time

319
00:26:52,170 --> 00:26:53,630
to avoid regrets

320
00:27:01,630 --> 00:27:03,040
Ask whatever you want

321
00:27:16,880 --> 00:27:18,920
You’re "The Elder,” right?

322
00:27:31,170 --> 00:27:33,630
How did you know Sun Rourou was kidnapped?

323
00:27:37,330 --> 00:27:38,380
Hsu Chenghan

324
00:27:39,830 --> 00:27:41,540
He told me

325
00:27:45,170 --> 00:27:47,830
I had him by your side

326
00:27:47,830 --> 00:27:49,580
to protect you secretly.

327
00:27:51,420 --> 00:27:52,920
What?

328
00:27:56,460 --> 00:28:00,290
Back then I chose to cut ties with you

329
00:28:00,290 --> 00:28:03,670
to stop you from becoming a cop

330
00:28:05,460 --> 00:28:08,710
But you chose that path anyway

331
00:28:12,790 --> 00:28:15,000
Once I was at an underground fight club

332
00:28:15,000 --> 00:28:17,040
and saw Hsu Chenghan fighting

333
00:28:18,080 --> 00:28:19,750
That’s when I knew

334
00:28:20,630 --> 00:28:22,000
He's someone

335
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:24,040
who could protect you with his life

336
00:28:25,040 --> 00:28:27,130
So I arranged for him

337
00:28:27,130 --> 00:28:29,920
to stay by your side secretly

338
00:28:30,540 --> 00:28:40,420
Beat him!

339
00:29:01,290 --> 00:29:03,880
So you didn’t trust me at all?

340
00:29:06,750 --> 00:29:08,790
Not that I don’t trust you

341
00:29:09,630 --> 00:29:11,420
It’s because…

342
00:29:13,790 --> 00:29:15,290
I care too much

343
00:29:16,580 --> 00:29:18,540
I’m afraid you’ll get hurt

344
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:27,580
Then why did you quit being an assassin?

345
00:29:31,290 --> 00:29:32,750
Because…

346
00:29:34,670 --> 00:29:36,460
An assassin can’t have weaknesses

347
00:29:38,960 --> 00:29:40,380
and yet…

348
00:29:41,790 --> 00:29:43,630
you are my weakness

349
00:30:01,830 --> 00:30:05,380
So when we go to a hot spring next time

350
00:30:05,380 --> 00:30:07,420
you don’t have to wear a swimsuit, right?

351
00:30:09,670 --> 00:30:11,420
You want me completely naked?

352
00:30:14,040 --> 00:30:15,670
That’s not what I mean

353
00:30:18,130 --> 00:30:19,920
But seriously

354
00:30:21,210 --> 00:30:23,580
the diamond situation has gotten really serious

355
00:30:23,580 --> 00:30:25,790
we need to figure out a solution

356
00:30:26,830 --> 00:30:28,500
I’m working on it

357
00:30:29,330 --> 00:30:31,500
We can’t delay this any longer

358
00:30:48,420 --> 00:30:51,500
What’s wrong? Did you have my cold?

359
00:30:51,500 --> 00:30:52,830
No

360
00:30:53,460 --> 00:30:55,710
I want you to go back and rest right now

361
00:30:55,710 --> 00:30:57,420
Wait, let me finish this first

362
00:30:59,080 --> 00:31:00,500
What are you doing?

363
00:31:00,500 --> 00:31:01,710
Come on

364
00:31:01,710 --> 00:31:03,380
Put me down!

365
00:31:07,920 --> 00:31:10,880
You're so close—aren’t you afraid getting my cold?

366
00:31:11,580 --> 00:31:13,630
Do I look scared?

367
00:32:39,420 --> 00:32:41,580
Kissing me first thing in the morning,

368
00:32:41,580 --> 00:32:42,880
didn’t get enough last night?

369
00:32:43,790 --> 00:32:46,000
I’m going to be late—I need to go to work

370
00:32:47,750 --> 00:32:49,250
How's your cold?

371
00:32:50,290 --> 00:32:51,290
Much better

372
00:32:58,830 --> 00:33:01,580
I didn’t expect my Compulsive behavioral disorder

373
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:03,500
to be cured without medicine

374
00:33:04,380 --> 00:33:05,790
after meeting Zhen

375
00:33:33,920 --> 00:33:34,790
Boss

376
00:33:34,790 --> 00:33:35,670
Last night, F.T. Crew

377
00:33:35,670 --> 00:33:37,790
sent assassins to capture Pan Hao at the club

378
00:33:43,130 --> 00:33:44,750
Did he get caught?

379
00:33:44,750 --> 00:33:45,670
No

380
00:33:45,670 --> 00:33:46,920
Ma Chengen stepped in to stop them

381
00:34:22,960 --> 00:34:24,040
Guys

382
00:34:24,040 --> 00:34:25,290
I’ve got good news …

383
00:34:25,290 --> 00:34:27,380
my Compulsive behavioral disorder…

384
00:34:27,380 --> 00:34:29,330
Hsu Chenghan, I missed you so much

385
00:34:29,330 --> 00:34:31,040
Don’t…

386
00:34:31,040 --> 00:34:32,500
Where did you go last night?

387
00:34:32,500 --> 00:34:34,670
Where were you when we're out fighting?

388
00:34:35,460 --> 00:34:38,880
I went to see Zhen

389
00:34:38,880 --> 00:34:41,080
She’s still around—you didn’t scare her off yet?

390
00:34:41,880 --> 00:34:43,080
Of course...

391
00:34:43,080 --> 00:34:44,830
The good news I wanted to share is

392
00:34:44,830 --> 00:34:47,040
my Compulsive behavioral disorder…

393
00:34:47,040 --> 00:34:49,580
was cured because of her

394
00:34:49,580 --> 00:34:51,420
Bullshit

395
00:34:52,880 --> 00:34:54,380
Seriously?

396
00:34:54,380 --> 00:34:55,420
That’s magical

397
00:34:55,420 --> 00:34:57,130
What's that —true love power?

398
00:34:57,130 --> 00:34:58,670
Almighty!

399
00:35:00,830 --> 00:35:02,580
Wait, you just said

400
00:35:02,580 --> 00:35:04,500
you guys went fighting last night?

401
00:35:04,500 --> 00:35:06,000
Yep

402
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:08,290
What's going on with them?

403
00:35:08,290 --> 00:35:10,540
Why is the mood so low?

404
00:35:10,540 --> 00:35:12,250
It’s Pan Hao

405
00:35:12,250 --> 00:35:15,210
His diamonds got Sun Rourou kidnapped

406
00:35:15,210 --> 00:35:17,540
Uncle Ma had to step in personally

407
00:35:17,540 --> 00:35:19,580
for us to rescue her yesterday

408
00:35:19,580 --> 00:35:21,290
Uncle Ma?

409
00:35:21,290 --> 00:35:23,000
Wow, something this intense

410
00:35:23,000 --> 00:35:24,670
and I missed it

411
00:35:27,420 --> 00:35:28,960
So Ma is

412
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:30,750
the assassin

413
00:35:32,630 --> 00:35:35,420
"The Elder," right?

414
00:35:35,420 --> 00:35:37,500
Do you know Yuchuan

415
00:35:37,500 --> 00:35:39,040
is actually a cop?

416
00:35:43,380 --> 00:35:45,080
What else are you hiding from me?

417
00:35:45,080 --> 00:35:45,920
Spill it out all at once

418
00:35:45,920 --> 00:35:48,670
Do you…

419
00:35:48,670 --> 00:35:50,040
You…

420
00:35:53,460 --> 00:35:55,790
About the diamonds

421
00:35:55,790 --> 00:35:58,250
I’ve heard about it from Yuchuan

422
00:36:00,630 --> 00:36:02,830
Now, I want to know

423
00:36:03,380 --> 00:36:05,420
how did you get involved

424
00:36:05,420 --> 00:36:06,670
with A.D.S.?

425
00:36:08,670 --> 00:36:12,830
This whole thing

426
00:36:12,830 --> 00:36:14,880
really happened a long long time ago

427
00:36:16,920 --> 00:36:20,790
I was just having noodles one day

428
00:36:22,960 --> 00:36:27,170
sent resumes to ten places without replies

429
00:36:27,170 --> 00:36:29,960
checked three part-time jobs and got all ignored

430
00:36:30,540 --> 00:36:33,580
I wasn’t “intimidating” enough even being an extra

431
00:36:41,000 --> 00:36:42,330
Go… I'll place orders

432
00:36:42,330 --> 00:36:43,460
Ma’am,

433
00:36:43,460 --> 00:36:44,540
two noodles

434
00:36:44,540 --> 00:36:46,330
one plate of tofu and braised eggs…

435
00:36:46,330 --> 00:36:47,750
and some pork cheeks

436
00:36:47,750 --> 00:36:48,790
Okay

437
00:36:51,500 --> 00:36:52,960
The delivery went smoothly

438
00:36:52,960 --> 00:36:53,830
Boss was very satisfied

439
00:36:53,830 --> 00:36:55,000
and gave us 200 on the spot

440
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:57,210
This job was easy money

441
00:36:57,210 --> 00:37:00,000
Especially that helper today

442
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:02,460
One word—excellent

443
00:37:02,460 --> 00:37:05,920
Fast and efficient

444
00:37:13,540 --> 00:37:15,580
Excuse me

445
00:37:15,580 --> 00:37:18,210
I overheard you mentioning deliveries

446
00:37:18,210 --> 00:37:19,960
Are you hiring?

447
00:37:19,960 --> 00:37:21,670
Who are you?

448
00:37:22,250 --> 00:37:23,790
I’m Pan Hao

449
00:37:23,790 --> 00:37:26,040
No background, no baggage

450
00:37:26,040 --> 00:37:27,630
But I work hard and follow orders

451
00:37:40,580 --> 00:37:41,920
You’ve got guts

452
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:43,460
Many people

453
00:37:43,460 --> 00:37:45,210
joined this gang

454
00:37:45,210 --> 00:37:47,710
But rarely

455
00:37:47,710 --> 00:37:48,580
as direct as you

456
00:37:48,580 --> 00:37:49,920
I like it

457
00:37:51,670 --> 00:37:52,670
Here

458
00:37:54,330 --> 00:37:55,790
Leave your numbers

459
00:37:55,790 --> 00:37:57,170
I’ll call you tomorrow

460
00:37:57,710 --> 00:37:58,750
Really?

461
00:38:05,170 --> 00:38:07,630
Azure Dragon Syndicate has spoken

462
00:38:07,630 --> 00:38:10,880
They want us to hand someone over to take the fall

463
00:38:15,420 --> 00:38:18,500
Do you want to draw lots for life and death

464
00:38:19,250 --> 00:38:20,880
or does anyone want to volunteer?

465
00:38:24,790 --> 00:38:26,920
No one? Really?

466
00:38:29,380 --> 00:38:31,290
In that case…

467
00:38:33,670 --> 00:38:34,540
Then… Boss,

468
00:38:34,540 --> 00:38:35,420
I—

469
00:38:35,420 --> 00:38:37,130
Alright, You it is

470
00:38:37,130 --> 00:38:39,380
It’s good for young people to step up

471
00:38:39,380 --> 00:38:40,920
That’s what I call guts

472
00:38:42,040 --> 00:38:43,290
Boss, what do I need to do?

473
00:38:52,710 --> 00:38:55,040
You’re the one sent by Shuntang?

474
00:38:55,040 --> 00:38:55,920
No, I—

475
00:38:55,920 --> 00:38:58,040
From now on, you’re one of us

476
00:38:58,040 --> 00:38:59,130
Come with me

477
00:39:04,000 --> 00:39:06,630
Later, Brother Zheng from A.D.S.

478
00:39:06,630 --> 00:39:09,790
called me over and said a few words

479
00:39:10,790 --> 00:39:12,790
I didn’t even know what happened

480
00:39:12,790 --> 00:39:14,710
and I became part of the gang

481
00:39:15,580 --> 00:39:17,630
As for the diamonds

482
00:39:17,630 --> 00:39:19,500
you already knew about it

483
00:39:24,630 --> 00:39:29,080
So everything about you joining the gang

484
00:39:29,080 --> 00:39:31,130
was built on misunderstandings?

485
00:39:33,000 --> 00:39:35,790
That’s life, isn’t it?

486
00:39:35,790 --> 00:39:38,210
Some are blessed with looks

487
00:39:38,210 --> 00:39:39,790
some with fighting skills

488
00:39:39,790 --> 00:39:42,540
or with powerful backgrounds

489
00:39:42,540 --> 00:39:43,920
As for me

490
00:39:43,920 --> 00:39:45,750
I rely on

491
00:39:45,750 --> 00:39:47,420
quick thinking—

492
00:39:47,420 --> 00:39:48,540
and misunderstandings

493
00:39:48,540 --> 00:39:50,040
That’s a kind of talent too

494
00:39:51,670 --> 00:39:53,790
I don’t know whether to call you a genius

495
00:39:53,790 --> 00:39:55,880
or a loser

496
00:39:55,880 --> 00:39:57,920
Genius

497
00:39:59,380 --> 00:40:01,750
I don’t care how you stumbled your way

498
00:40:01,750 --> 00:40:03,290
into A.D.S.

499
00:40:04,210 --> 00:40:05,170
This diamond issue

500
00:40:05,170 --> 00:40:06,250
is no longer something

501
00:40:06,250 --> 00:40:07,880
you can walk away from alone

502
00:40:08,460 --> 00:40:10,080
It’s not just A.D.S.

503
00:40:10,540 --> 00:40:12,790
F.T. Crew is involved too

504
00:40:17,960 --> 00:40:19,380
I’ll set up a plan

505
00:40:20,830 --> 00:40:24,000
to settle everything at once

506
00:40:24,420 --> 00:40:25,540
But

507
00:40:27,750 --> 00:40:29,630
you need to work with me

508
00:40:30,710 --> 00:40:33,000
Okay, thank you

509
00:40:33,000 --> 00:40:35,170
I’ll follow your lead

510
00:40:37,920 --> 00:40:39,540
Also,

511
00:40:39,540 --> 00:40:43,170
I have a very, very small request

512
00:40:43,170 --> 00:40:45,170
I’d like to ask of you

513
00:41:19,040 --> 00:41:22,330
Ma said you wanted to talk to me

514
00:41:22,330 --> 00:41:23,380
I’d like to hear

515
00:41:23,380 --> 00:41:25,670
what’s so important for me to come in person

516
00:41:46,330 --> 00:41:48,750
Pan Hao has really gotten bold

517
00:41:48,750 --> 00:41:50,540
daring to negotiate with Qin

518
00:41:51,540 --> 00:41:54,380
Maybe he has someone he truly wants to protect

519
00:42:05,420 --> 00:42:07,880
You had your people kidnap mine?

520
00:42:09,790 --> 00:42:11,040
Who?

521
00:42:13,580 --> 00:42:15,750
Ah-Jun kidnapped Sun Rourou

522
00:42:15,750 --> 00:42:18,250
to force Pan Hao to hand over the diamonds

523
00:42:23,040 --> 00:42:24,920
That guy finally got smarter

524
00:42:26,880 --> 00:42:27,880
Smart?

525
00:42:31,290 --> 00:42:34,250
Smart enough to screw everything

526
00:42:39,250 --> 00:42:41,210
Look what's happened now

527
00:42:41,830 --> 00:42:43,580
Not only Ma Chengen stepped in to rescue her

528
00:42:43,580 --> 00:42:46,630
now Sun Rourou is completely on Pan Hao’s side

529
00:42:46,630 --> 00:42:47,920
He even threaten me with our photos

530
00:42:47,920 --> 00:42:50,420
to release her

531
00:42:59,330 --> 00:43:01,040
Find Ah-Jun

532
00:43:01,710 --> 00:43:02,830
Immediately

533
00:43:13,670 --> 00:43:15,580
Don’t be mad

534
00:43:15,580 --> 00:43:17,420
I’ll take care of it

535
00:43:31,210 --> 00:43:32,460
Yes, Boss

536
00:43:34,750 --> 00:43:37,670
Got it—I’ll head over right now

